Release log of FastqCheck

===================== Version1.0.0 =====================
Version: 1.0.0
Date:    2022-07-25
Author:  xiaolong zhang
Email:   zhangxiaolong@big.ac.cn
Descrip:
    1. support for single-end and multiple (pair-end) fastq files
    2. phred and pair-marker ('1', '2') consistency check
    3. windows break check ('\r\n')
    4. check whether the read name of multiple fastq files are in same order
    5. check duplication of read name in the fastq file.
    6. calculate distribution of bases('ACTGN'), quality and read length


===================== Version1.1.0 =====================
Version: 1.1.0
Date:    2022-08-05
Author:  xiaolong zhang
Email:   zhangxiaolong@big.ac.cn
Descrip:
    1. update the bloom_filter to version 1.2 to support for larege files (uin32_t -> uint64_t)
    2. add release log for fastqcheck
    3. bloomfilter_init(): 
        modified the fix parameters ('0.15' -> '0.25') to enable allocate more memory for bloomfilter
    4. fastq_statistics_process():
        fix the potential bug that induced by memory resize of f_len_obj->n_max
    5. modified the memory resize step from '<<5' to '<<3'
    6. output the quality score(calculated with phred) rather than ASCII of quality
    7. only the fatal error can cause the program to exit


===================== Version1.1.1 =====================
Version: 1.1.1
Date:    2022-08-11
Author:  xiaolong zhang
Email:   zhangxiaolong@big.ac.cn
Descrip:
    1. update how error message are displayed (only show once for the same error message)
    2. add line number where the error message occured
    3. modify the structure of message_t
        (1) add cache_status, n_duplicate, length_check, pair_check, win_break_check, phred_check 
        (2) make these variables globally accessible


